Problem
Apache service not reachable on port 6400. Find and fix the issue.

Solution
bash
# Check Apache service status
sudo systemctl status apache2

# If not running, start it
sudo systemctl start apache2

# Check port listening
sudo netstat -tlnp | grep 6400

# Check firewall
sudo ufw status
sudo ufw allow 6400/tcp

# Test locally
curl http://localhost:6400

# Test from jump host
curl http://stapp03:6400
